# Prefect Velor Qastor — scrub T3 legendary duelist (senior Color administrator)

[title Prefect Velor Qastor]
[image monsters/scrub_boss.png]
[blood #6b3aa0]
[stats hp=24]
[trigger road]

* move Defend
  narration: He folds his hands and the angles of the hall sharpen around him.

* move Riposte Attack
  narration: He gestures, and the Color from him cuts across your line as you press forward.

* move Tainted Heavy Slow Stunning Attack
  narration: He lowers his head fractionally, the walls of the hall brighten, and the Color folds out of him with administrative force, landing on you.

* move Heavy Power Shielding Defend
  narration: The hall aligns itself around him for a moment, geometry sharpening, and the Color settles on him like a robe.

* move Heavy Power Recover
  narration: He breathes in once, evenly. The Color in his eyes deepens, and what you took from him is no longer missing.

* intro
The hall is geometrically too perfect: angles a fraction sharper than
your eye can hold, walls that brighten on no schedule. The man who rises
to greet you wears the formal pleating of a senior interior administrator,
and the Color is deep in him, in his eyes and the breath he speaks with.
"Ah. The traveler. I have read your function. There is a small
irregularity, and I have the authority to address it personally." He
smiles, briefly, the way a polite host smiles. "Please. Set down what you
are carrying. The correction is brief."

* win
+give_gold 25
+add_tag killed_prefect_qastor
The Color goes out of him the way a lamp goes out: at once and
completely. The angles of the hall settle a fraction softer. The
pleating of his robe folds neatly under him as he sinks down, the way a
senior administrator's robe ought to.

* lose
The correction is, as he said, brief. The angles of the hall settle. The
geometry continues to be very perfect.
